OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,F2nd September marks the 40th
OL,8,Fanniversary of a significant relaunch
OL,9,Fof the Nine o'Clock News.
OL,11,FComputer graphics were introduced, new
OL,12,Ftitles and music were produced and the
OL,13,Fprogramme moved to a two-presenter
OL,14,Fformat.
OL,16,FBut look carefully at the listings for
OL,17,Fthat week and there is a little
OL,18,Fmystery.
OL,20,FRadio Times shows that the new look
OL,21,FNine o'Clock News was supposed to be
OL,22,Ffollowed by a regional news bulletin.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn fact, the bulletin did not appear
OL,8,Funtil 6th January 1986.
OL,10,FRadio Times billed the regional news
OL,11,Ffor the first two weeks of September
OL,12,F1985 ` with the subsequent programme
OL,13,Fstarting at 9.30pm.
OL,15,FThe regional news wasn't listed from
OL,16,F16th September and the following
OL,17,Fprogramme was billed with a 9.25pm
OL,18,Fstart.
OL,20,FSo what happened?
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12503
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC had never provided mid-evening
OL,8,Fregional news bulletins previously.
OL,9,FHowever most English regions closed the
OL,10,Fnight with a regional news summary
OL,11,Fbefore English regional presentation
OL,12,Fwas dropped in 1980.
OL,14,FThe nations still provided a bulletin
OL,15,Fat closedown ` albeit read
OL,16,Fout-of-vision by the announcer in
OL,17,FScotland and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12504
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FBy 1985 most ITV regions had short
OL,8,Flocal summaries after News at Ten
OL,9,Falthough some were poorly produced. The
OL,10,Fannouncer would simply read a script
OL,11,Fwith no autocue or moving pictures.
OL,13,FSo a regional news bulletin after the
OL,14,FNine o'Clock News seemed to be an
OL,15,Foverdue response by the BBC.
OL,17,FThe move coincided with two other
OL,18,Fdevelopments.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12505
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,F- The start of regional news bulletins
OL,8,Fin London and the south east. The
OL,9,Fregion only got a dedicated regional
OL,10,Fnews magazine, London Plus, in 1984
OL,11,Fafter the end of Sixty Minutes. However
OL,12,Fthere were no short bulletins at other
OL,13,Ftimes. This was put right on 2nd
OL,14,FSeptember 1985.
OL,16,F- The move of the weekly regional
OL,17,Fprogrammes in England to BBC Two where
OL,18,Fthey were shown at 8pm on Fridays.
OL,19,FPreviously they had been screened on
OL,20,FBBC One in the late evening.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12506
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo why was the plan for mid-evening
OL,8,Fbulletins suddenly postponed?
OL,10,FWere there practical issues such as
OL,11,Fdisputes over the rota? Were some
OL,12,Fregions initially unable to provide
OL,13,Fthem? Does anyone who worked in a
OL,14,Fregional newsroom in 1985 know what
OL,15,Fhappened?
OL,17,FEither way the 2-minute bulletin
OL,18,Ffinally appeared in January 1986. It
OL,19,Fwas extended to around 3 minutes in
OL,20,F1995 and doubled in length when the
OL,21,Fnetwork news moved to 10pm in 2000.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12507
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FBy the way, the schedule changes in
OL,8,F1985 meant routine opts on BBC Two in
OL,9,FEngland for the first time.
OL,11,FUntil then, they were exceptional ` for
OL,12,Finstance the early evening regional
OL,13,Fnews magazines moved to BBC Two during
OL,14,Fthe 1980 Olympics.
OL,16,FApparently significant engineering work
OL,17,Fhad to take place in 1985 to make
OL,18,Fregular opting on BBC Two in England
OL,19,Fpractical. The channel's distribution
OL,20,Fnetwork was previously not tailored to
OL,21,Fallow for straightforward opting unlike
OL,22,Fthe BBC One distribution system.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12508
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F125A1784147298
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCThe mystery of the delayed
OL,4,Claunch for the new BBC regional news
OL,5,Cslot
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is important not to confuse the
OL,8,Fability of each region to opt out on
OL,9,FBBC2 locally with "regional" trade test
OL,10,Ftransmissions which were a regular
OL,11,Foccurrence on the channel in the
OL,12,Fafternoon.
OL,14,FBirmingham, Cardiff and Glasgow
OL,15,Finserted Test Card G into the network
OL,16,Fdistribution circuit ` but these
OL,17,Fbroadcasts were seen across much of the
OL,18,Fcountry and not just their local areas.
OL,20,FThis took place so the BBC Two feed
OL,21,Ffrom London could be used to send
OL,22,Fprogramme material to the regions.
OL,23,APub: 30-Aug-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,126,120,200,300,0,100
